    "text": "1 days ago OREGON HOUSE, CA (MPG) - Seniors on the Go has launched the Foothills Computer Literacy Program, a new initiative that will provide free computer basics instruction, digital literacy education and ongoing public computer access for residents of the Yuba County foothills. The program is funded through an AARP Community Challenge... Read full article\n1",
